// /usr/bin, /usr/local/bin, /usr/sbin/ /usr/local/sbin
a. In /usr/bin, here those executable gets store which are installed by OS or package manager
b. If we install any executable manually then we store them in /usr/local/bin
c. sbin is for system adminstration utilities, so we those are installed by package manager then they go to
   /usr/sbin and if we installed them then it will go to /usr/local/sbin
d. and all these paths are stored in PATH environment variable